message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "C2CS: Code to Common Semantics"
abstract: >-
  C2CS explores whether Large Language Models can infer high-level program
  semantics well enough to improve security decisions and least-privilege
  policy generation. The core pipeline is Code → semantic inference → policy
  proposal, deriving policy from inferred high-level intent rather than from
  observed low-level behavior.
type: software
